# TBC Classic 2.5.x and the Anniversary product (also 2.5.x) do NOT expose
# boss1..boss5 unit IDs — those landed in Cataclysm 4.0. So this TOC loads
# the same Vanilla-style SodSlotProvider that scans target + nameplates,
# and the new Classic / SoD options tab applies here as well.

